{"id": "t047-001", "text": "Caught up with Delroy over coffee. His birthday's June 3rd and he keeps going on about wanting a record player. The kids are at his mum's that weekend so he's free. Remind me to sort something by the 1st.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Delroy", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "birthday", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "June 3rd", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "wanting a record player", "fact_type": "other", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "kids", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "that weekend", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "sort something", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "by the 1st", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t047-002", "text": "Long chat with Katarzyna (Kasia) last night. She flies to Warsaw May 14 at 6am, then gets the train to her gran's. Dreading the four hour layover in Frankfurt. I should text her the night before. Her sister wants her to bring back pierogi for the whole family, which is a lot to fit in hand luggage.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Katarzyna", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kasia", "pronoun": "she", "same_as": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "last night"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flies to Warsaw", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "May 14 at 6am", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "gran", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "Dreading the four hour layover", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "text her", "action_type": "message", "timing": "before", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the night before", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "sister", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t047-003", "text": "Anika and Ryan are off to Japan for three weeks, leaving 9/2. Ryan has never done a long-haul flight and he's properly nervous, keeps reading about turbulence. Anika just wants Kyoto recommendations and someone to water the plants. Said I'd pop round the evening before to get the spare key.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Anika", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ryan", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "off to Japan", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "three weeks", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "9/2", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ryan", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "nervous", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Anika", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the evening before", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t047-004", "text": "Irina called. Her brother Lukas turns 40 on the 12th, drinks at the Crown from half 7. Apparently he's got really into fly fishing. Need to get a card and something small.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Irina", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lukas", "pronoun": "he", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "turns 40", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 12th", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "drinks at the Crown", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "from half 7", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "fly fishing", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "get a card and something small", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t047-005", "text": "Tunde's surprise party for Erin is off, she found out. They're doing a quiet dinner Saturday at 8 instead. Tunde says she's obsessed with her pottery class right now so vouchers would go down well. Chip in with him on those.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Tunde", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Erin", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "quiet dinner", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday at 8", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Tunde", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "pottery class", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "vouchers would go down well", "fact_type": "other", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Chip in with him on those", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t047-006", "text": "Spoke to Henrik, he's back from Iceland. Flight home was delayed nine hours but he says the northern lights made up for it. Eva didn't go in the end, stayed home with their dog Bjorn who'd just had his op.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Henrik", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "back from Iceland", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Eva", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "dog Bjorn", "fact_type": "pet", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "op", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t047-007", "text": "Eva's mum has her hip operation on October 28 at 9am. Eva's driving her in and is pretty anxious about the whole thing. Don't forget to message her that evening.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Eva", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "hip operation", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "October 28 at 9am", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Eva", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "pretty anxious", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "message her", "action_type": "message", "timing": "on", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "that evening", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t047-008", "text": "Kieran and Stefan are coming to stay, probably the weekend of the 21st. I'm doing a roast on the Sunday. Stefan's gone vegetarian.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kieran", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Stefan", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "coming to stay", "event_type": "other", "followup": "none", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "probably the weekend of the 21st", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the Sunday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Stefan", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "vegetarian", "fact_type": "diet", "owner": "p2"}]}
{"id": "t047-009", "text": "Laura's birthday is 7/9. Into bouldering and true crime podcasts at the moment. Hates anything scented, so no candles.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Laura", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "birthday", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "7/9", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "bouldering", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i2", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "true crime podcasts", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "Hates anything scented", "fact_type": "dislike", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t047-010", "text": "Picked up the passport renewal form. Post it tomorrow morning before 10, photo booth at the station first.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Post it", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "tomorrow morning before 10", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "photo booth at the station", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "first", "anchor": "a2"}]}
{"id": "t047-011", "text": "Chidi rang from Lagos, he's out there until August 30 for his cousin's wedding. The line kept cutting out. Must call him back Sunday afternoon his time. He sounded happy though, said the aunties have been feeding him nonstop and his cousin's fiance is a great guy.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Chidi", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "until August 30"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "cousin", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "wedding", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "congratulate", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "call him back", "action_type": "call", "timing": "unspecified", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday afternoon his time", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "happy", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "aunties", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r3", "type": "RELATION", "text": "cousin", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r4", "type": "RELATION", "text": "fiance", "owner": "r1"}]}
{"id": "t047-012", "text": "Ryan and Kiara had their anniversary dinner on Friday and he proposed! Wedding probably next summer. Kiara's sister Yasmin is already planning the hen.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ryan", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kiara", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "anniversary dinner", "event_type": "anniversary", "followup": "congratulate", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "proposed", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "congratulate", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Wedding", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "congratulate", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "probably next summer", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kiara", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "sister", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p4"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Yasmin", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "e4", "type": "EVENT", "text": "hen", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "congratulate", "owner": "p2"}]}
{"id": "t047-013", "text": "Yasmin's flight to Toronto got cancelled, now rebooked for Thursday at 11pm. She's knackered and stressed she'll miss her friend Zoe's graduation on the 18th.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Yasmin", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flight to Toronto", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thursday at 11pm", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "knackered", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "stressed", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "friend", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zoe", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "graduation", "event_type": "school", "followup": "congratulate", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 18th", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t047-014", "text": "Zoe passed her driving test! Third time lucky. Remind me to send her something.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zoe", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "driving test", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "congratulate", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send her something", "action_type": "send", "timing": "after", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t047-015", "text": "Coffee with Erin. She's started at the hospital pharmacy, loves it but the commute is brutal. Her partner Hemi is on nights for the next month. They're thinking about moving closer in the spring.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Erin", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "started at the hospital pharmacy", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "loves it", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "commute is brutal", "fact_type": "other", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "partner", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Hemi", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "on nights", "fact_type": "job", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the next month"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving closer", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "in the spring", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t047-016", "text": "Pooja's little boy turns 5 on March 2nd. Dinosaurs, everything is dinosaurs. Party's the Saturday after, 2 till 4 at the soft play.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Pooja", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "little boy", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "turns 5", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "March 2nd", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "Dinosaurs", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Party", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the Saturday after", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "2 till 4", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t047-017", "text": "Hemi wants the photos from Rarotonga, send them over tonight. He still owes me his auntie's address in Auckland so I can post her the scarf.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Hemi", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send them over", "action_type": "send", "timing": "unspecified", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "tonight", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "auntie", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t047-018", "text": "Chris is running the Lisbon half on 3/22, his first one ever. He's been struggling with his knee and isn't sure he'll finish. Text him good luck the day before.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Chris", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Lisbon half", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "wish_luck", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "3/22", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "struggling with his knee", "fact_type": "health", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Text him good luck", "action_type": "wish_luck", "timing": "before", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the day before", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t047-019", "text": "Bumped into Mabel at the shop. Her cat Pickle went missing on Tuesday and turned up last night, very thin. She's taking him to the vet tomorrow at 4.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mabel", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "cat Pickle", "fact_type": "pet", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "went missing", "event_type": "other", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Tuesday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "last night"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "vet", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "tomorrow at 4", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t047-020", "text": "Dev is thinking about Vietnam over Christmas and asked if I'd come. Check annual leave.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dev", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Vietnam", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "over Christmas", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Check annual leave", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t047-021", "text": "Bethany and Ravi's housewarming is Saturday from 7. They finally got the flat in Leith. Ravi doesn't drink, so bring something fizzy for him as well as wine.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Bethany", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ravi", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "housewarming", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday from 7", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "got the flat in Leith", "event_type": "move", "followup": "congratulate", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ravi", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "doesn't drink", "fact_type": "diet", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "bring something fizzy for him as well as wine", "action_type": "other", "timing": "on", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t047-022", "text": "Gareth's dad passed away last week. Funeral is November 4 at 11am in Swansea and he has to sort most of it himself because his brother is stuck in Dubai. He's holding up but sounds exhausted. Chris and I are driving down together the night before. I should call him at the weekend.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Gareth", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "passed away", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "last week", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Funeral", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "none", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "November 4 at 11am", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "brother", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "holding up", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "exhausted", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Chris", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the night before", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "call him", "action_type": "call", "timing": "after", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "the weekend", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t047-023", "text": "Mohammed and his wife are expecting their second in May. He's already worrying about flying to see her family in Amman with a newborn.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mohammed", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "wife", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "expecting", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in May", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "worrying", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "family", "owner": "r1"}]}
