{"id": "t047-025", "text": "Ask Caitlin how her interview went, it was this morning at 10. Claire said she'd been up all night prepping.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Ask Caitlin how her interview went", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Caitlin", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "interview", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "this morning at 10", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Claire", "pronoun": "unknown"}]}
{"id": "t047-026", "text": "Claire's off to Thailand tomorrow, flight's at 6:40am. Leaving her dog Biscuit with the neighbour.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Claire", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "off to Thailand", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "tomorrow", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "6:40am", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "dog Biscuit", "fact_type": "pet", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "neighbour", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t047-027", "text": "Jakub's birthday is Nov 9. He mentioned wanting a decent rain jacket for his Tatras trip in the spring. He's a large.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jakub", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "birthday", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Nov 9", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "wanting a decent rain jacket", "fact_type": "other", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Tatras trip", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "in the spring", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "a large", "fact_type": "other", "owner": "p1"}]}
