{"id": "t047-029", "text": "Phoned Katarzyna. The visit to Anika's is called off, Anika's got flu. Maybe the 30th instead.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Katarzyna", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Anika", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Anika", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flu", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Maybe the 30th"}]}
{"id": "t047-030", "text": "Book dentist. Pick up dry cleaning Friday after work. Renew car insurance before 11/15.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Book dentist", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Pick up dry cleaning", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday after work", "anchor": "a2"}, {"id": "a3", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Renew car insurance", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "before 11/15", "anchor": "a3"}]}
{"id": "t047-031", "text": "Irina says Henrik is moving to Oslo for work in January. He's nervous about the new job but excited. She's organising a leaving do for him on Dec 12 at 7, so keep that free. Lukas reckons it's his chance to finally learn proper Norwegian, he's already doing Duolingo every morning.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Irina", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Henrik", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving to Oslo", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in January", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "nervous", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "new job", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "excited", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "leaving do", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Dec 12 at 7", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "keep that free", "action_type": "other", "timing": "on", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lukas", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "doing Duolingo", "fact_type": "other", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "every morning"}]}
{"id": "t047-032", "text": "Stefan and Chris celebrate ten years on the 5th, dinner in Bath. Stefan's getting Chris a watch and I've sworn not to say anything.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Stefan", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Chris", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "ten years", "event_type": "anniversary", "followup": "congratulate", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 5th", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "dinner in Bath", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Stefan", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Chris", "pronoun": "unknown"}]}
{"id": "t047-033", "text": "Tunde's sister Mabel gets her A level results on 8/14. Tunde says she's been a wreck about it. Text her that morning.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Tunde", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "sister", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mabel", "pronoun": "she", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "A level results", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "8/14", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Tunde", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "a wreck", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Text her", "action_type": "message", "timing": "on", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "that morning", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t047-034", "text": "Henrik likes Nordic noir, cold-water swimming and anything with cardamom in it.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Henrik", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "Nordic noir", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i2", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "cold-water swimming", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i3", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "cardamom", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t047-035", "text": "Quick call with Kieran. He's in Dubai for work until Thursday then flies on to Sydney, landing Saturday at 5am. Already sounded jet-lagged.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kieran", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "in Dubai for work", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "until Thursday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flies on to Sydney", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday at 5am", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "jet-lagged", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t047-036", "text": "Must post Zoe's present by Wednesday morning. Her birthday's Friday the 17th and the post is useless.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "post Zoe's present", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zoe", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "by Wednesday morning", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "birthday", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday the 17th", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t047-037", "text": "Laura said her mum has been in and out of hospital and she's really struggling to juggle it with work. Don't push her about the trip. Maybe pop round next week with some food.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Laura", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "in and out of hospital", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "struggling to juggle it with work", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "trip", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "pop round", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "after", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next week", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t047-038", "text": "Dinner with Chidi, Pooja and Ravi. Pooja's doing her yoga teacher training, finishes in June. Ravi's got an allotment now and won't stop talking about squash. Chidi is still looking for a flat and his landlord wants him out by the end of next month.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Chidi", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Pooja", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ravi", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Pooja", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "yoga teacher training", "event_type": "school", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in June", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ravi", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "allotment", "fact_type": "other", "owner": "p3"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "squash", "owner": "p3"}, {"id": "p6", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Chidi", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "looking for a flat", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "landlord", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "by the end of next month", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t047-039", "text": "Video call Auntie Irina on Sunday at 2. It's her 70th on July 4th and she wants everyone on the call together.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Video call Auntie Irina", "action_type": "call", "timing": "unspecified", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Auntie Irina", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday at 2", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "70th", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "July 4th", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t047-040", "text": "Ryan had his appendix out on Tuesday. Kiara says he's grumpy but fine. Should drop off some books.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ryan", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "had his appendix out", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Tuesday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kiara", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "grumpy", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "fine", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "drop off some books", "action_type": "send", "timing": "after", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1"}]}
