{"id": "t047-042", "text": "Lunch with Gareth, mostly football chat. He's still at the council, still hates the open plan office.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Gareth", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "football", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "at the council", "fact_type": "job", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "hates the open plan office", "fact_type": "dislike", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t047-043", "text": "Luca and Caitlin met at Spanish class and now they're going to Seville together in October! Luca is terrified of flying so Caitlin booked the train via Paris. Took her three evenings to work out the connections. They want to have everyone round for paella when they're back.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Luca", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Caitlin", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "met at Spanish class", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "going to Seville", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in October", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Luca", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "terrified of flying", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Caitlin", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "when they're back", "anchor": "e1"}]}
