{"id": "t047-046", "text": "Claire's son starts uni in Edinburgh on Sept 15. She's driving him up the weekend before and is more upset than he is. Her husband Stefan is staying behind with the twins, who are apparently thrilled to get the big bedroom.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Claire", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "son", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "uni in Edinburgh", "event_type": "school", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sept 15", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the weekend before", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "upset", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "husband", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Stefan", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "twins", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "thrilled", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "r2"}]}
{"id": "t047-047", "text": "Eva texted, can't do Thursday any more because her shift changed. Coffee moved to Saturday at 10.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Eva", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thursday"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Coffee", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday at 10", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t047-048", "text": "Met Jakub's girlfriend Anika Morris at the barbecue. She's a vet, just back from six months in Chile. Jakub is clearly smitten.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jakub", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "girlfriend", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Anika Morris", "pronoun": "she", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "vet", "fact_type": "job", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "back from six months in Chile", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jakub", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "smitten", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t047-049", "text": "Katarzyna's back from Poland and her gran is doing much better. Remind me to ask her for the photos and whether she still wants to do Krakow on 5/14 next year.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Katarzyna", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "back from Poland", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "gran", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask her for the photos and whether she still wants to do Krakow", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "do Krakow", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "none", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "5/14 next year", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t047-050", "text": "Dev's wedding in Jaipur is Dec 2nd to 4th. Flights are crazy. I'm flying out on the 29th, Ravi's coming on the 1st, and Dev's cousin Pooja is sorting the hotel block for everyone. Dev's mum wants us all in proper outfits for the sangeet, so a tailor trip is needed once I land.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dev", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "wedding in Jaipur", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "none", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Dec 2nd to 4th", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flying out", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 29th", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ravi", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 1st"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dev", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "cousin", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p4"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Pooja", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dev", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "sangeet", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "none", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "tailor trip", "action_type": "other", "timing": "after", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "once I land", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t047-051", "text": "Pick up the keys from Bethany tomorrow evening after 6. She's away from the 8th to the 22nd and I'm feeding her cat Smudge.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Pick up the keys from Bethany", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Bethany", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "tomorrow evening after 6", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "away", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "from the 8th to the 22nd", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "cat Smudge", "fact_type": "pet", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t047-052", "text": "Chris says Gareth's been really quiet since the breakup. Worth a call this week, just to see how he is.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Chris", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Gareth", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "quiet", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "breakup", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "a call", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "this week", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t047-053", "text": "Mabel's birthday is the 23rd. She said ages ago she wants a proper sourdough starter kit.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mabel", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "birthday", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 23rd", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "ages ago"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "wants a proper sourdough starter kit", "fact_type": "other", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t047-054", "text": "Long call with Kiara this morning. Her dad's retiring on June 30 after 35 years at the bank, and they're throwing him a party the Saturday after at their place. Kiara wants to fly her uncle in from Manila as a surprise but the tickets are silly money. She's also just started a pottery course on Tuesday nights and seems a lot happier than she was in the spring. Remind me to send her dad a card the week before.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kiara", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "this morning"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "retiring", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "June 30", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "35 years at the bank", "fact_type": "job", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "party", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the Saturday after", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kiara", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "uncle", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "pottery course", "event_type": "school", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "Tuesday nights", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "happier", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "in the spring"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send her dad a card", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before", "owner": "r1", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r3", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d6", "type": "DATE", "text": "the week before", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t047-055", "text": "Dr Ito said the results will be back by 11/3. Call the surgery after 2pm that afternoon.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dr Ito", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "results", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "by 11/3", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Call the surgery", "action_type": "call", "timing": "on", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "after 2pm that afternoon", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t047-056", "text": "Packing for Canada: adapters, warm coat, Laura's book to give back. Taxi booked for 4:15am Monday.", "spans": [{"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Canada", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "adapters", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "warm coat", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a3", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Laura's book to give back", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Laura", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "4:15am Monday", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t047-057", "text": "Anika's dissertation is due May 20 at noon and she's barely sleeping. Henrik and I are taking her out for curry once it's in.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Anika", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "dissertation", "event_type": "school", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "May 20 at noon", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Henrik", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "once it's in", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t047-058", "text": "Uncle Henrik's knee replacement went well yesterday, home by Friday hopefully. Auntie says he's already bored out of his mind. Send him the crossword books.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Uncle Henrik", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "knee replacement", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "yesterday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "by Friday"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "Auntie"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "bored out of his mind", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Send him the crossword books", "action_type": "send", "timing": "after", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t047-059", "text": "Pooja and Dev fly back from Goa tonight, landing 7:25 tomorrow morning. I'm doing the airport run so leave by 6.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Pooja", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dev", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "fly back from Goa", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "none", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "tonight", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "7:25 tomorrow morning", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "leave", "action_type": "other", "timing": "on", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "by 6", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t047-060", "text": "Long catch-up with Ryan and Zoe at the pub. Zoe has accepted a place on a midwifery course starting in January and is moving back to Leeds for it, which means selling the flat in a hurry. Ryan's band has a gig at the Brudenell on 12/6 at 8 and he wants a big crowd. He also mentioned his mum's 60th is coming up in the new year, she's into gardening and gin. I should get the gig tickets this week.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ryan", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zoe", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zoe", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "accepted a place", "event_type": "school", "followup": "congratulate", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "midwifery course", "event_type": "school", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in January", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving back to Leeds", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "e4", "type": "EVENT", "text": "selling the flat", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ryan", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e5", "type": "EVENT", "text": "gig at the Brudenell", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "12/6 at 8", "anchor": "e5"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e6", "type": "EVENT", "text": "60th", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "in the new year", "anchor": "e6"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "gardening", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "i2", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "gin", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "get the gig tickets", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e5"}, {"id":